# ABP Entity Cache

## Enabling Entity Cache
```csharp
public interface IBookCache : IEntityCache<BookCacheItem, Guid>
{
}

public class BookCache : EntityCache<Book, BookCacheItem, Guid>, IBookCache
{
    public BookCache(
        IDistributedCache<BookCacheItem, Guid> cache,
        IRepository<Book, Guid> repository,
        IObjectMapper objectMapper)
        : base(cache, repository, objectMapper)
    {
    }
}
```

## Using Entity Cache
```csharp
var book = await _bookCache.GetAsync(bookId);
```

## Features
- Read-only cache
- Auto-invalidation on entity update/delete
- Uses distributed cache
